  "details": "- CVE-2026-8328: ftplib: make ftpcp() use the source server's peer address\n  instead of the host advertised in its PASV reply, as makepasv() already does\n- CVE-2026-7774: tarfile: check the normalized link target written to disk\n  and reject links that resolve to the destination directory itself\n- CVE-2026-3276: unicodedata: sort combining character runs in linear time so\n  normalize() no longer takes quadratic time on long alternating runs\n- CVE-2026-12003: getpath: drop the Modules/Setup.local build landmark\n  fallback and require pybuilddir.txt to detect an in-tree run\n- CVE-2026-19672: tarfile: normalize member names containing \"..\" so the\n  filters no longer create directories outside the destination\n- CVE-2026-15806: urllib.request: scope HTTPPasswordMgr credentials by URL\n  scheme so https credentials are not sent over plain http",
